                  "block_order": [
                    "intro",
                    "description",
                    "note"
                  ]
                },
                "row_dimensions": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Dimensions & UK sizes",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "ruler",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>UK mattress sizes:</p><ul><li>Small single — 2ft6 · 75 × 190cm</li><li>Single — 3ft · 90 × 190cm</li><li>Small double — 4ft · 120 × 190cm</li><li>Double — 4ft6 · 135 × 190cm</li><li>King — 5ft · 150 × 200cm</li><li>Super king — 6ft · 180 × 200cm</li></ul><p>The frame sits a little larger than the mattress it takes. Leave around 60cm of walking space each side where the room allows, and 90cm in front of wardrobe doors so they open fully.</p><p>Measure the doorway and any turn on the stairs before ordering. Everything ships flat-packed and assembles in the room, so it is the built footprint rather than the boxes that usually decides.</p>",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text"
                  ]
                },
                "row_delivery": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Delivery",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "truck",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Free to any UK mainland address, with no minimum spend. Express Dispatch beds leave us within 1–3 working days; everything else within 4. We email tracking as soon as it ships, and the courier confirms your delivery day in advance.</p><p>Delivery is by specialist large-item courier <strong>to your front door</strong>. Someone over 18 needs to be in to receive it.</p><p>Northern Ireland, the Scottish Highlands and UK islands are quoted separately — email us before ordering and we will confirm your postcode and any additional cost.</p>",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text"
                  ]
                },
                "row_returns": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Returns & exchanges",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "return",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>You have 30 days from delivery. The item must be unused, in original condition and original packaging, so keep the packaging until you are certain. We quote the collection cost before you commit and deduct it from your refund, or you may arrange your own tracked courier. Refunds are issued within 14 days of the bed reaching us.</p><p>For hygiene reasons a mattress can be returned as a change of mind only while still sealed in its protective packaging. Once unsealed it can be returned only if faulty.</p><p>Damaged in transit, or a part missing? Email azixparz@outlook.com within 48 hours with photos and your order number. Collection for faulty goods is arranged and paid for by us, and your rights under the Consumer Rights Act 2015 are unaffected.</p>",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text"
                  ]
                },
                "row_care": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Care",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "washing",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Vacuum upholstery on a low setting every few weeks to stop dust settling into the pile. Blot spills immediately with a clean, dry cloth rather than rubbing — velvet and bouclé mark most when worked at.</p><p>Keep the bed out of prolonged direct sunlight, which fades fabric unevenly over time. Check and re-tighten the frame bolts after the first month and once a year after that; almost every creak reported to us is a loose bolt rather than a fault.</p>",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text"
                  ]
                }
